==Trivia==
*The Big Bang has its own theme, officially named "Big Bang Kumikyoku" (ビッグバン組曲, "Big Bang Suite") in the Battle Cats CD. So far, it can only be heard here, in the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]], in the [[Moon (Aku Realm)|Aku Realms Moon/Iriomote]], in [[Ape Lord's Revenge]] or in the [[The Face of God/Invasion|The Face of God Invasion]].
*The background for this stage is the same as the one used in [[Black Hole (Cats of the Cosmos)|Black Hole]], but altered to more closely resemble a scorched field of nothingness.
**The enemy base is also similar to Black Hole's, except that the tree has opened up and formed a portal.
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|version 11.5]], the first group of [[Zoge]]s in Ch.1's Zombie Outbreak was set to spawn between 3.33 and 0.07 seconds instead of just 3.33 seconds. It didn't work properly because the maximum times were lower than the minimum, so in practice nothing changed.

